  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut capsicum and carrot into bite-sized chunks.\n• Slice zucchini into rounds.\n• Slice onion into thick wedges.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67847165f2efe8ce6099160a-fcd29266.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place veggies and chickpeas on a lined oven tray.\n• Sprinkle with chermoula spice blend, drizzle with olive oil, season with a pinch of salt and toss to coat.\n• Spread out evenly, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. Allow to cool slightly. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67847165f2efe8ce6099160a-314b2825.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, chop mini flour tortillas (see ingredients) into wedges.\n• While veggies are cooling, spread tortilla chips over a second lined oven tray (don’t worry if they overlap).\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Bake until lightly golden and crisp, 8-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67847165f2efe8ce6099160a-3cd4d856.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Once veggies are cooled, in a large bowl, combine roasted veggies, tortilla chips, mixed salad leaves, a drizzle of white wine vinegar and golden goddess dressing. Season to taste.\n• Divide fattoush-style chickpea and veggie salad between bowls.\n• Top with Greek-style yoghurt and sprinkle over fetta cubes to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67847165f2efe8ce6099160a-e05941fa.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
